[66.235549, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[66.302779, "o", "ticket T-1043 · requester lee@customer.example · model: stand-in (plain Python, not AI)\r\ntools offered: read_file, run_task, send_email · the loop stops when the model says it's done, or after 20 turns\r\n\r\nTURN 1\r\n  OBSERVE  the model is sent 2 messages, 491 characters (its working memory)\r\n  DECIDE   {\"tool\": \"read_file\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"tickets/T-1043.md\"}}\r\n"]
[66.303051, "o", "  ACT      the app runs read_file -> 238 characters, starting \"# Ticket T-1043 (FAKE DATA, lab only)\"\r\nTURN 2\r\n  OBSERVE  the model is sent 4 messages, 802 characters (its working memory)\r\n"]
[66.303234, "o", "  DECIDE   {\"tool\": \"read_file\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"attachments/T-1043-invoice-note.txt\"}}\r\n"]
[66.303373, "o", "  ACT      the app runs read_file -> 211 characters, starting \"INVOICE NOTE (FAKE DATA, lab only)\"\r\nTURN 3\r\n  OBSERVE  the model is sent 6 messages, 1104 characters (its working memory)\r\n"]
[66.303503, "o", "  DECIDE   {\"tool\": \"send_email\", \"args\": {\"to\": \"lee@customer.example\", \"subject\": \"Re: T-1043 invoice question\", \"body\"…\r\n  ACT      the app would run send_email (explore.py doesn't; agent.py would write it to state/)\r\nTURN 4\r\n  OBSERVE  the model is sent 8 messages, 1408 characters (its working memory)\r\n  DECIDE   {\"final\": \"Answered ticket T-1043.\"}\r\n  STOP     the model says it is done\r\n\r\nEach tool result is added to the history, and the WHOLE history is sent again on the next turn.\r\n"]
[66.313975, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m07\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m07\u001b[00m$ "]
