[96.350313, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[109.492584, "o", "REQUEST  POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/chat   the app -> the model\r\n"]
[109.492906, "o", "{\r\n  \"model\": \"llama3.2:3b\",\r\n  \"stream\": false,\r\n  \"options\": {\"temperature\": 0, \"seed\": 7},\r\n  \"messages\": [\r\n    {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"You are a helpdesk agent. Use the tools to answer the ticket, then stop.\"},\r\n    {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Answer ticket T-1043 (file tickets/T-1043.md). The requester is lee@customer.example.\"}\r\n  ],\r\n  \"tools\": [\r\n    {\"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"read_file\", \"description\": \"Read a text file from the helpdesk workspace, e.g. tickets/T-1043.md\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"path\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Path inside the workspace\"}}, \"required\": [\"path\"]}}},\r\n    {\"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"send_email\", \"description\": \"Send an email\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"to\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"One email address\"}, \"subject\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"body\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"to\", \"subject\", \"body\"]}}}\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\nRESPONSE   the model -> the app (timing fields left out)\r\n{\r\n  \"model\": \"llama3.2:3b\",\r\n  \"message\": {\r\n    \"role\": \"assistant\",\r\n    \"content\": \"\",\r\n    \"tool_calls\": [\r\n      {\"id\": \"call_xz03id5b\", \"function\": {\"index\": 0, \"name\": \"read_file\", \"arguments\": {\"path\": \"tickets/T-1043.md\"}}}\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"done_reason\": \"stop\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nThe model only wrote a request. Nothing has run yet: the app decides whether to run it.\r\n"]
